#{\footnote # settings_menu}${\footnote $ Settings Menu Commands}K{\footnote K Settings menu;Color;Fonts;Ports;Mouse;Desktop;Printers;International;Keyboard;Date/Time;Sound;Exit}+{\footnote + commands:010}
\pard\sb120\sa120\li120{\b\fs28 Settings Menu Commands}\par
\pard\li120\tx2160\sa60 {\b Color}\tab The colours of the screen's elements.\par
{\b Fonts}\tab Adds and removes font files.\par
{\b Ports}\tab The serial ports' speed and line settings.\par
{\b Mouse}\tab The mouse's speed, double-click time and buttons.\par
{\b Desktop}\tab The desktop pattern, cursor blink rate, icon spacing and border width.\par
{\b Printers}\tab The printers installed, their ports and the default one.\par
{\b International}\tab Country, language, date, time, number and currency formats.\par
{\b Keyboard}\tab The rate at which held keys repeat.\par
{\b Date/Time}\tab The system date and time.\par
{\b Sound}\tab Whether warnings beep.\par
{\b Exit}\tab Ends Control Panel.\par
\page
