#{\footnote # changing_settings}${\footnote $ Changing a Setting}K{\footnote K Changing a Setting}+{\footnote + procedures:010}
\pard\sb120\sa120\li120{\b\fs28 Changing a Setting}\par
\pard\li120\sa60\sb60{\b To change a setting}\par
\pard\li360\fi-240\sa60 1.\tab Double-click its icon, or choose it from the Settings menu.\par
2.\tab Make the changes in the dialog box.\par
3.\tab Choose OK. Running programs are told of the change.\par
\page
#{\footnote # fonts}${\footnote $ Adding Fonts}K{\footnote K Adding Fonts}+{\footnote + procedures:020}
\pard\sb120\sa120\li120{\b\fs28 Adding Fonts}\par
\pard\li120\sa120 In Fonts, choose Add and select a .FON file. Its fonts are added to [fonts] in WIN.INI and become available immediately. Remove uninstalls them.\par
\page
